# DS5002: a barchart's default x is the first string column.
mode: check
schema: t(customerId: string, month: datetime, revenue: real, n: long)
---- query
from t
| project month, revenue
| render barchart
---- expected
error[DS5002]: `barchart` needs a `string` column for the x-axis, but the result has none
  --> query:3:10
  |
3 | | render barchart
  |          ^^^^^^^^ no column for the x-axis
  |
  = help: name the x-axis column with `xcolumn = ...`; it can have any type
  = note: the result's columns: month: datetime, revenue: real
